# STEM Learning Analytics

A reproducible machine-learning feasibility study for routing English STEM
questions to Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, or Biology. The repository is
under active implementation; verified results will replace this notice after
the artifact-driven reporting stage is complete.

The project code is MIT licensed. MMLU-Pro data is governed separately by its
upstream dataset card and is downloaded only by documented local commands.

